 a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">37</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-3-t2-l-q37\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> event.</li><li>The football clubs were responsible for most of the <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-3-t2-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> and development for the football association.</li><li><span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-3-t2-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> against other teams were also organised by the football clubs.</li><li>In 1910s, <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-3-t2-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> football players were approved of in the game.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":8}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/recent_actual_test_3_academic_listening_test_2_4.m4a"],"order_index":4}],"questions":[{"id":"en-practice-source-3-t2-l-q1","part_id":"en-practice-source-3-t2-l-p1","group_id":"en-practice-source-3-t2-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"July","correct_answer_variants":["July"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[1],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3126130_1","order_index":1,"points":1},{"id":"en-practice-source-3-t2-l-q2",